{"lines":[{"y":0.088989101846967733,"w":0.2471703592936198,"h":0.034517785617020236,"x":0.057836904879578391,"c":1,"t":"Audioscripts"},{"h":0.023365767479556987,"c":1,"t":"TEST 1","y":0.15914869216075866,"w":0.10021089553833007,"x":0.36530418848781326},{"x":0.05827067572304917,"y":0.21947674390043126,"t":"SECTION 1","w":0.14285714467366536,"c":1,"h":0.015988372635703185},{"w":0.062279167175292964,"t":"OFFICIAL:","x":0.056266431397393006,"y":0.25104377122872801,"c":1,"h":0.012447341211519136},{"y":0.26792167830048075,"t":"WOMAN.","h":0.0094358876529847535,"x":0.058077103866724898,"w":0.054818738301595053,"c":1},{"h":0.01441614380668832,"c":1,"t":"OFFICIAL:","y":0.29729774193406988,"w":0.062479801177978508,"x":0.056166114773485667},{"c":1,"x":0.056345267075342612,"y":0.34725463698108883,"t":"WOMAN:","w":0.054602699279785158,"h":0.011886074707266991},{"w":0.061159286499023441,"t":"OFFICIAL:","h":0.012913328712399585,"y":0.36310985481675195,"x":0.056068964323594914,"c":1},{"t":"WOMAN:","h":0.011894273972864466,"y":0.39521565362904099,"c":1,"x":0.056343833386291182,"w":0.054605566660563147},{"c":1,"w":0.060150375366210942,"h":0.011627907148116789,"t":"OFFICIAL:","x":0.056390977719371307,"y":0.41133720918243954},{"t":"WOMAN:","h":0.01053860965883513,"c":1,"y":0.42859697422213605,"w":0.052747685114542635,"x":0.056332924269303204},{"h":0.012191889137125655,"c":1,"w":0.060329081217447914,"x":0.056301625220139373,"y":0.44303196229579422,"t":"OFFICIAL:"},{"t":"WOMAN.","y":0.49227573547112313,"w":0.051002063751220704,"h":0.0096345755336979533,"c":1,"x":0.058145584572271168},{"x":0.056390978143962205,"w":0.060150375366210936,"h":0.013081395234588844,"t":"OFFICIAL:","c":1,"y":0.5072674417867753},{"h":0.011827470100240767,"c":1,"t":"WOMAN:","y":0.54059789283573589,"w":0.052704947789510084,"x":0.056354292928686128},{"w":0.060458087921142586,"c":1,"t":"OFFICIAL:","x":0.056237122012805729,"y":0.55479740742653871,"h":0.013951696431490967},{"y":0.62063953473989508,"w":0.052631578445434576,"c":1,"x":0.056390977450215055,"h":0.011627907148116789,"t":"WOMAN:"},{"c":1,"y":0.65261627910579256,"t":"OFFICIAL:","x":0.056390977639475183,"h":0.013081395234588844,"w":0.060150375366210936},{"y":0.69964915777646974,"h":0.014610064543989942,"x":0.055644247149873427,"c":1,"w":0.054261156717936215,"t":"WOMAN:"},{"t":"OFFICIAL:","h":0.016455449523729238,"y":0.73118630778711968,"c":1,"x":0.056950646472694592,"w":0.061012115478515629},{"y":0.81834940666985723,"w":0.061485214233398436,"c":1,"t":"OFFICIAL:","h":0.01804452393796474,"x":0.056823872278476226},{"y":0.84966897526877716,"w":0.056614964803059907,"h":0.018357641069027819,"t":"WOMAN:","x":0.056311579514565994,"c":1},{"t":"OFFICIAL:","x":0.056772979616592188,"y":0.86636072614703596,"w":0.061367448170979812,"h":0.017908938838371746,"c":1},{"t":"WOMAN:","w":0.056397151947021482,"x":0.056425483594787093,"y":0.89787790763557085,"h":0.017790696733011702,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.24652986679746824,"h":0.032887510998511615,"w":0.53881332397460935,"t":"Hello, Tourist Information Centre, Mike speaking, how can I help you?","x":0.1647404106945542},{"x":0.1648192645815082,"y":0.26347617354567143,"h":0.031195169560616076,"c":1,"t":"Oh, hi. I wanted to find out about cookery classes. I believe there are some","w":0.58007375081380208},{"c":1,"x":0.16325446289268758,"h":0.017933524967544856,"y":0.28125145230162574,"w":0.22802716573079429,"t":"one-day classes for tourists?"},{"x":0.16292844520316577,"y":0.29582042361780081,"t":"Well, they're open to everyone, but tourists are always welcome. OK, let me","h":0.031322135360334569,"c":1,"w":0.58939702351888024},{"x":0.16317023004829148,"y":0.31252698191946937,"t":"give you some detalls of what's available. There are several classes. One very","w":0.60796498616536465,"h":0.029656043608420446,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.16320325959086326,"t":"popular one is at the Food Studio.","y":0.32883509764574814,"h":0.020215674975727405,"w":0.26777826944986982},{"h":0.013081395234588733,"w":0.033834587732950838,"c":1,"y":0.34593023257165911,"x":0.16353383385282286,"t":"Oк."},{"h":0.028984597937491197,"t":"They focus on seasonal products, and as well as teaching you how to cook","w":0.58368530273437502,"c":1,"x":0.16298369247863528,"y":0.36074864150939356},{"w":0.37136337280273435,"h":0.024406544868975311,"c":1,"t":"them, they also show you how to choose them.","x":0.16119187271728974,"y":0.37696980931508628},{"h":0.024013875456525668,"t":"Right, that sounds good. How big are the classes?","y":0.39290129015509379,"x":0.16313392758787104,"c":1,"w":0.39369544982910154},{"t":"I'm not sure exactly, but they'll be quite small.","c":1,"y":0.40905143799468879,"h":0.024292451523229897,"x":0.16124054147737496,"w":0.35809941609700513},{"h":0.021191859199243934,"w":0.30534477233886714,"t":"And could I get a private lesson there?","x":0.16122366393728868,"y":0.42590666278570177,"c":1},{"x":0.16116336654543184,"t":"I think so... let me check, yes, they do offer those. Though in fact most of","y":0.44231394166703786,"h":0.027263159914624691,"c":1,"w":0.57610427856445312},{"x":0.16113368789723134,"y":0.45770706299853325,"t":"the people who attend the classes find it's a nice way of getting to know one","w":0.59123535156249996,"h":0.028780795341142862,"c":1},{"h":0.015703294634895726,"c":1,"x":0.16309913801912898,"y":0.47471613904447463,"t":"another.","w":0.067033150990804036},{"w":0.20603432973225913,"t":"I suppose it must be, yes.","x":0.16107164406146415,"y":0.49068109103697677,"h":0.020561145799665059,"c":1},{"x":0.16122309419802205,"w":0.6042195638020833,"h":0.028743203501507941,"c":1,"y":0.50636394243254357,"t":"And this company has a special deal for clients where they offer a discount of"},{"c":1,"x":0.1612384145398382,"y":0.52314598812625634,"h":0.022134662979430564,"t":"20 percent if you return for a further class.","w":0.33358266194661457},{"h":0.021671874862444818,"t":"OK. But you said there were several classes?","x":0.16131787528715297,"y":0.53990948151249596,"c":1,"w":0.35966133117675786},{"y":0.55513232000372104,"w":0.61178161621093752,"x":0.16123538280072428,"t":"That's right. Another one you might be interested in is Bond's Cookery School.","h":0.027885432099037155,"c":1},{"t":"They're quite new, they just opened six months ago, but l've heard good things","y":0.57248710297236782,"w":0.61357599894205728,"h":0.027041238120349864,"c":1,"x":0.16127039709609572},{"h":0.025589178396054235,"t":"about them. They concentrate on teaching you to prepare healthy food, and","x":0.16132400307231298,"y":0.5898317902509318,"w":0.5889653523763021,"c":1},{"h":0.018812586089832384,"c":1,"t":"they have quite a lot of specialist staff.","y":0.60567526819956341,"x":0.16142226003105392,"w":0.29932840983072911},{"t":"So is that food for people on a diet and things like that? I don't know if I'd be","x":0.1631646995434945,"c":1,"w":0.58901194254557288,"h":0.024277290987799627,"y":0.6216356006647159},{"t":"interested in that.","x":0.16124961035858737,"h":0.016656862100477232,"y":0.63778439461792047,"w":0.13802462259928383,"c":1},{"y":0.6538581336118896,"t":"Well, I don't think they particularly focus on low calorie diets or weight loss. It's","x":0.1612585408456412,"w":0.6078905741373698,"c":1,"h":0.026972687789415972},{"y":0.67123476014072836,"w":0.59071085611979168,"h":0.022912317142130378,"x":0.16143387056777092,"c":1,"t":"more to do with recipes that look at specific needs, like including ingredients"},{"x":0.16134710235306254,"w":0.59082799275716136,"y":0.68711391745991668,"h":0.023185788932647999,"t":"that will help build up your bones and make them stronger, that sort of thing.","c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.024767623282369255,"w":0.60206888834635408,"x":0.16132845964944559,"t":"I see. Well, I might be interested, I'm not sure. Do they have a website I could","y":0.70337304619445018},{"w":0.058314933776855454,"c":1,"t":"check?","x":0.16163200670191483,"y":0.71941773000670062,"h":0.013199423638298957},{"x":0.16316774660260214,"w":0.60399220784505203,"h":0.024959905640355884,"c":1,"t":"Yes, just key in the name of the school - it'll come up. And if you want to know","y":0.73532100775546694},{"t":"more about them, every Thursday evening they have a lecture at the school.","x":0.16332261796170788,"w":0.59063181559244793,"h":0.021884611170290391,"y":0.75341393483859798,"c":1},{"t":"It's free and you don't need to book or anything, just turn up at 7.30. And that","c":1,"y":0.76726605960265104,"h":0.024950060626421133,"x":0.16139041860765133,"w":0.59824534098307292},{"t":"might give you an idea of whether you want to go to an actual class.","c":1,"h":0.021958741079356248,"x":0.16328945254638635,"y":0.78582834316054939,"w":0.5267708333333333},{"w":0.57000259399414066,"t":"OK, there's one more place you might be interested in. That's got a rather","c":1,"h":0.024074163885171918,"x":0.16328010390621833,"y":0.82388617637808859},{"y":0.8429155944186083,"c":1,"w":0.58672724405924481,"h":0.020055018005567526,"t":"strange name, it's called The Arretsa Centre - that's spelled A-R-R-E-T-S-A.","x":0.16338649948010925},{"h":0.023426097665996792,"y":0.87346102018266902,"t":"They've got a very good reputation. They do a bit of meat and fish cookery but","w":0.60564717610677077,"x":0.16329575400622343,"c":1},{"x":0.16121039878704779,"w":0.34296096801757814,"y":0.8893470009838319,"c":1,"h":0.023117942343353848,"t":"they mostly specialise in vegetarian dishes."},{"c":1,"t":"Right. That's certainly an area I'd like to learn more about. I've got lots of","w":0.56230534871419269,"x":0.16337423102072687,"h":0.0225311765652354,"y":0.9054637974454921},{"w":0.59990107218424482,"t":"friends who don't eat meat. In fact, I think I might have seen that school today.","x":0.16336933401155174,"y":0.92287761957275682,"h":0.022176358136375418,"c":1},{"h":0.020389630574989659,"t":"Is it just by the market?","c":1,"x":0.16106504810834774,"w":0.18528513590494791,"y":0.93872080902220334},{"y":0.33927405563819935,"x":0.7835756351928006,"h":0.015195916563330081,"t":"Example","c":1,"w":0.075685272216796884},{"y":0.39098837209564175,"h":0.013081395234588733,"x":0.78571428574578428,"t":"Q1","c":1,"w":0.026315789222717267},{"w":0.026315789222717267,"h":0.013081395234588733,"c":1,"y":0.43895348836975634,"t":"Q2","x":0.78571428575432822},{"c":1,"t":"Q5","y":0.69622093023936937,"x":0.78383458650489346,"w":0.026315789222717378,"h":0.013081395234588733},{"h":0.014534883321060788,"x":0.78195488738112262,"t":"Q7","c":1,"y":0.84593023261272537,"w":0.026315789222717267},{"w":0.026315789222717267,"y":0.89389534883982769,"h":0.013081395234588844,"x":0.78195488724954365,"t":"Q8","c":1},{"x":0.7819548868510483,"t":"Q9","y":0.94186046511889743,"c":1,"w":0.02443609078725173,"h":0.013081395234588844},{"c":1,"y":0.96075581409286115,"t":"97","x":0.83646616544503238,"w":0.026315789222717267,"h":0.014534883321060788}],"h":3106,"w":2400}